        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANNSIM-PAGETURNER-PIPELINE-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-PIPELINE-INTEGRATED-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-REVIEW-PHASES-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PAGETURNER-RENDERMAN-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TWIN-TELEMETRY-BOUND     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-INTEGRATED-PROOF-WITNESS PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-INTEGRATED-PIPELINE.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-INTEGRATED-PIPELINE.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-REVIEW-PHASES-OK = 1 AND
               WS-PAGETURNER-RENDERMAN-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TWIN-TELEMETRY-BOUND = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-INTEGRATED-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-INTEGRATED-PROOF-WITNESS.
